8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/308164178","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2940#issuecomment-308164178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2940","id":308164178,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwODE2NDE3OA==","user":{"login":"cspencer404","id":20114776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTE0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20114776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404","html_url":"https://github.com/cspencer404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-06-13T15:57:42Z","updated_at":"2017-06-13T15:57:42Z","body":"From the spec ATSC Standard: Digital Audio Compression (AC-3, E-AC-3), Doc. A/52:2015 24 November 2012\r\n\r\nFor AC3, section 5.4.2.3 indicates a max of 5 channels, but this does not include the LFE which is the `lfeon` flag defined in 5.4.2.7. So, 6 channels total.\r\n\r\nFor EAC3, section E.3.8.2: \"The maximum number of channels rendered for a single program is 16\". This seems to include the LFE channel.\r\n\r\nI can update my pull request to check for these channel counts.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/308164178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cspencer404","id":20114776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTE0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20114776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404","html_url":"https://github.com/cspencer404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cspencer404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/308168059","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2940#issuecomment-308168059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2940","id":308168059,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwODE2ODA1OQ==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-06-13T16:10:28Z","updated_at":"2017-06-13T16:10:43Z","body":"If we set to the max according to the spec then that's probably the same as assuming support for unlimited channels, because it's likely impossible to make streams with more channels than the spec allows. We're more interested in what the actual decoder implementations support, which may well be less than the maximums according to the spec (e.g. I'm not convinced `OMX.dolby.ec3.decoder` can actually support 16 channel input). We can try and do some digging also, to figure out what the correct values should be.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/308168059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gra